        "content": "<h2><strong>Unrivalled Quality with Zap</strong></h2><p>Zap is a leading name in the adhesive industry, consistently providing high-performance products. Whether you are working on model kits or need something for minor repairs, Zap's super glue and Zap CA have you covered. Trusted by hobbyists and professionals alike, Zap's products ensure your projects stand the test of time.</p><p>Note: For detailed application instructions and safety information, please refer to the product packaging or consult with our knowledgeable staff.</p><h2><strong>Diverse Range of Zap Adhesives</strong></h2><p>Our collection of Zap adhesives is perfect for all types of hobby and modelling projects. From the super-strong Zap super glue, ideal for small, quick fixes, to the versatile Zap a gap glue for filling gaps, there's a Zap product for every need. Furthermore, for model aircraft enthusiasts, we recommend Zap's canopy glue, specially formulated for clear plastic parts.</p><h2><a href=\"https://www.hearnshobbies.com/collections/adhesives\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Adhesives | Plastic Glue | Hearns Hobbies\">Explore Our Full Range of Adhesives</a></h2><p>Looking for more than just Zap? Hearns Hobbies offers an extensive range of adhesives, including other popular brands like<a href=\"https://www.hearnshobbies.com/collections/bob-smith\"> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Bob Smith</span></a>. Find the perfect adhesive for your specific requirements in our<a href=\"https://www.hearnshobbies.com/collections/adhesives\"> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">full collection</span></a>.</p><h2><strong>More than Just Adhesives</strong></h2><p>At Hearns Hobbies, we offer more than just adhesives. Browse our vast selection of<a href=\"https://www.hearnshobbies.com/pages/paints-and-tools\"> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">paints and tools</span></a>, explore our<a href=\"https://www.hearnshobbies.com/pages/model-kits\"> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">model kits</span></a>, or return to our<a href=\"https://www.hearnshobbies.com/\"> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">homepage</span></a> to see everything we have in store.</p>",
        "button_text": "",
